    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251216001744\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"400\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"400\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251216001744\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"825\" height=\"1406\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fressa Sherbet Princess Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSherbet Princess\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA travelling dancer who is said to weave ice magic into her performances. The men captivated by her twirling, leaping and skating upon a frozen stage are as unending as the less careful men battered, shattered and scattered by her magical prowess.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:79px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wik